{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/0e12e110f6a4e024601db56f647b16c1.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1280 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/941a1465634a4c4fa5d0eec1a30bb70c.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Heroes of Anirea is a turn-based tactical RPG that incorporates innovative mechanics and a faster pace to the classic strategy games. Adapt to the enemy, the environment, and your heroes in a combat system with elemental strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/c7926a55b37f6fb2f2e8cf54d19f2008.poster.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/c7926a55b37f6fb2f2e8cf54d19f2008.webm?t=1766273526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/656063d2e5f163b3431b7156261bf28d.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover every hero of Anirea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each hero has a unique skill set and a story waiting to be discovered. Unlock new allies during the game and learn how to get the most out of them in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/9c10708a0059310d17027d780dfadb3a.poster.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/9c10708a0059310d17027d780dfadb3a.webm?t=1766273526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/6a963cb20d49245e32d18f5918d9d0bd.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Failure is not the end!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Begin your journey anew with new heroes and once again experience another unique adventure in a procedurally generated campaign system. Collect and equip items, make\u00a0impactful  choices, and face the destiny of Anirea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/9285c59a862a3bf13e73d5f4c8429f9a.poster.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/9285c59a862a3bf13e73d5f4c8429f9a.webm?t=1766273526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783410/extras/382b4dc63a45596a3073f2bcfd211fb8.avif?t=1766273526\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: ce